msgid "Writes field values of a draft or pending entry, by path (for example _title, hero_title, sections.0.text). Values are validated like in the Leiho editor (types, required fields, maximum lengths); refused fields are returned in errors. Never publishes, and refuses entries that are published, scheduled or private. Pass the revision from leiho/get-entry to avoid overwriting someone else’s changes."
