msgid "Creates a new draft of a content type edited in Leiho, with a title and optional field values by path (see leiho/list-collections). Values are validated like in the Leiho editor; refused fields are returned in errors. The entry is always a draft: this never publishes. Read leiho/get-brand-context first."
