#: includes/ai/class-leiho-ai-abilities.php:245
msgid "Suggest an alternative text"
msgstr ""

#: includes/ai/class-leiho-ai-abilities.php:246
msgid "Describes an image of the media library with the AI provider set up in WordPress and returns a suggested alternative text, checked against the brand context. Saves nothing: to keep it, update the alt_text of the media item through the WordPress media endpoints. Available only when the provider can read images."
